      "statement": "CallRecorder ignores callbacks outside a sink, records a Call on on_llm_end only for a ChatGeneration with an AIMessage (using ls_model_name and ls_provider captured at start and the start time as called_at), and on_llm_error drops the pending entry so failed attempts produce no Call.",
